  <BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_7.titleShort>小铁匠</BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_7.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] learned to gather herbs and prepare poultices, helping treat minor injuries in the village.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] is knowledgeable of plants but not very strong.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_8.description>[PAWN_nameDef]学会了采集草药与制作膏药，帮助治疗村庄里的轻伤。[PAWN_pronoun]对植物知识十分了解，但体格不算强壮。</BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_8.description>
  <!-- EN: Herbalist's Apprentice -->
  <BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_8.title>草药学徒</BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_8.title>
