  <BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_8.titleShort>小医师</BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_8.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] helped run a family stall, learning negotiation and the value of goods from a young age.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] is social and clever but not strong.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_9.description>[PAWN_nameDef]帮助家里经营摊位，从小就学会了谈判技巧与商品价值判断。[PAWN_pronoun]善于社交、机智灵活，但体格不强壮。</BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_9.description>
  <!-- EN: Merchant's Child -->
  <BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_9.title>商人之子</BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_9.title>
  <!-- EN: Trader -->
  <BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_9.titleShort>小商贩</BA_Turkic_Basic_Child_9.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] was taken from their village at a young age as part of the devshirme levy. Trained to serve the Sultan's army, [PAWN_pronoun] learned discipline, obedience, and early martial skills.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] feels torn between their homeland and the strict life imposed upon them.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_Turkic_Devshirme_Child_1.description>[PAWN_nameDef]在年幼时作为德夫希尔梅征兵制的一员被带离村庄。为服务苏丹军队而接受训练的[PAWN_pronoun]学会了纪律、服从与基础的军事技能。[PAWN_pronoun]在故土与被强加的严苛生活之间左右为难。</BA_Turkic_Devshirme_Child_1.description>
  <!-- EN: Tough Devshirme Recruit -->
  <BA_Turkic_Devshirme_Child_1.title>坚毅的德夫希尔梅新兵</BA_Turkic_Devshirme_Child_1.title>
  <!-- EN: Recruit -->
  <BA_Turkic_Devshirme_Child_1.titleShort>新兵</BA_Turkic_Devshirme_Child_1.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] was taken from their village at a young age as part of the devshirme levy. Trained to serve the Sultan's army, [PAWN_pronoun] learned discipline, obedience, and early martial skills.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] feels torn between their homeland and the strict life imposed upon them.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_Turkic_Devshirme_Child_2.description>[PAWN_nameDef]在年幼时作为德夫希尔梅征兵制的一员被带离村庄。为服务苏丹军队而接受训练的[PAWN_pronoun]学会了纪律、服从与基础的军事技能。[PAWN_pronoun]在故土与被强加的严苛生活之间左右为难。</BA_Turkic_Devshirme_Child_2.description>
  <!-- EN: Nimble Devshirme Recruit -->
