  <BA_Turkic_Devshirme_Child_2.titleShort>新兵</BA_Turkic_Devshirme_Child_2.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] learned the art of fine handwriting, copying manuscripts for the local scribe. [PAWN_pronoun] developed patience and a steady hand.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_Turkic_Educated_Child_1.description>[PAWN_nameDef]学会了精湛的书法技艺，为当地抄写员抄写手稿。[PAWN_pronoun]培养出了耐心与稳定的手劲。</BA_Turkic_Educated_Child_1.description>
  <!-- EN: Apprentice Calligrapher -->
