  <BA_Turkic_Educated_Child_1.titleShort>小书法家</BA_Turkic_Educated_Child_1.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] spent long hours discussing ethics and logic with teachers. [PAWN_pronoun] grew thoughtful, curious, and somewhat reserved.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_Turkic_Educated_Child_2.description>[PAWN_nameDef]花费大量时间与老师探讨伦理与逻辑问题。[PAWN_pronoun]变得善于思考、充满好奇心，同时也有些内敛。</BA_Turkic_Educated_Child_2.description>
  <!-- EN: Philosopher's Pupil -->
