  <BA_Turkic_Educated_Child_2.titleShort>小哲学家</BA_Turkic_Educated_Child_2.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] learned to play the ud, accompanying local minstrels and learning melodies of the region. [PAWN_pronoun] developed dexterity and a love for music.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_Turkic_Educated_Child_4.description>[PAWN_nameDef]学会了演奏乌德琴，为当地吟游诗人伴奏并学习该地区的旋律。[PAWN_pronoun]练就了灵巧的指法，同时爱上了音乐。</BA_Turkic_Educated_Child_4.description>
  <!-- EN: Udi Apprentice -->
