  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] trained in the art of epic storytelling and folk singing, reciting tales of heroes and love. [PAWN_pronoun] became persuasive and creative.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_Turkic_Educated_Child_5.description>[PAWN_nameDef]接受了史诗讲述与民间演唱的训练，吟诵英雄与爱情的故事。[PAWN_pronoun]变得极具说服力与创造力。</BA_Turkic_Educated_Child_5.description>
