  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] was selected by a noble patron to train at the Enderun palace school. [PAWN_pronoun] learned etiquette, administration, and swordsmanship, preparing for service in high offices or military roles within the state.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_Turkic_Enderun_Native_Student.description>[PAWN_nameDef]被贵族赞助人选中进入恩德伦宫学校学习。[PAWN_pronoun]学习礼仪、行政管理与剑术，为日后在国家高阶职位或军事岗位任职做准备。</BA_Turkic_Enderun_Native_Student.description>
  <!-- EN: Native Enderun Student -->
  <BA_Turkic_Enderun_Native_Student.title>恩德伦本土学生</BA_Turkic_Enderun_Native_Student.title>
  <!-- EN: Palace Student -->
  <BA_Turkic_Enderun_Native_Student.titleShort>宫廷学生</BA_Turkic_Enderun_Native_Student.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] was selected through the devshirme system and trained in the Enderun Palace School. [PAWN_pronoun] learned discipline, etiquette, and administration from a young age, preparing for service in the palace or military.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_Turkic_Enderun_Student.description>[PAWN_nameDef]通过德夫希尔梅制度被选中，进入恩德伦宫学校接受训练。[PAWN_pronoun]从小学习纪律、礼仪与行政管理，为在宫廷或军队任职做准备。</BA_Turkic_Enderun_Student.description>
