  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] grew up in the household of a Pasha, learning the ways of leadership, protocol, and strategy from a young age. [PAWN_pronoun] observed advisors, trained with guards, and learned the importance of honor and duty.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_Turkic_Pasha_Child_1.description>[PAWN_nameDef]在帕夏的宅邸中长大，从小学习领导力、礼仪规范与战略之道。[PAWN_pronoun]观察顾问们的工作，与守卫一同训练，并领悟到荣誉与职责的重要性。</BA_Turkic_Pasha_Child_1.description>
  <!-- EN: Pasha's Child -->
